{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "y'=y, y(0) = 1\n  transformed: (s - 1)Y(s) - 1 = 0\n  Y(s) = 1/(s - 1)\n  y(t) = e^t    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: 1\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 1.8e-09\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace_solve", "ucas": "laplace solve y'=y, y(0)=1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace_solve", "transformed": "(s - 1)Y(s) - 1 = 0", "Y(s)": "1/(s - 1)", "y(t)": {"value": "e^t", "valid_for": "t >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "1", "headline": "y'=y, y(0) = 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)"}, {"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 1.8e-09"}], "files": [], "text": "y'=y, y(0) = 1\n  transformed: (s - 1)Y(s) - 1 = 0\n  Y(s) = 1/(s - 1)\n  y(t) = e^t    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: 1\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 1.8e-09\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "y'' + y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s^2 + 1)Y(s) - (s) = 0\n  Y(s) = s/(s^2 + 1)\n  y(t) = cos(t)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: +-i\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 6.6e-14\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace_solve", "ucas": "laplace solve y'' + y = 0, y(0)=1, y'(0)=0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace_solve", "transformed": "(s^2 + 1)Y(s) - (s) = 0", "Y(s)": "s/(s^2 + 1)", "y(t)": {"value": "cos(t)", "valid_for": "t >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "+-i", "headline": "y'' + y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)"}, {"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 6.6e-14"}], "files": [], "text": "y'' + y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s^2 + 1)Y(s) - (s) = 0\n  Y(s) = s/(s^2 + 1)\n  y(t) = cos(t)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: +-i\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 6.6e-14\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "y'' - 3y' + 2y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s^2 - 3s + 2)Y(s) - (s - 3) = 0\n  Y(s) = (s - 3)/((s - 1)*(s - 2))\n  y(t) = 2*e^t - e^(2t)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: 1, 2\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 4.8e-07; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 0.0013\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace_solve", "ucas": "laplace solve y'' - 3y' + 2y = 0, y(0)=1, y'(0)=0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace_solve", "transformed": "(s^2 - 3s + 2)Y(s) - (s - 3) = 0", "Y(s)": "(s - 3)/((s - 1)*(s - 2))", "y(t)": {"value": "2*e^t - e^(2t)", "valid_for": "t >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "1, 2", "headline": "y'' - 3y' + 2y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 4.8e-07; initial values hold (max difference 0)"}, {"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 0.0013"}], "files": [], "text": "y'' - 3y' + 2y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s^2 - 3s + 2)Y(s) - (s - 3) = 0\n  Y(s) = (s - 3)/((s - 1)*(s - 2))\n  y(t) = 2*e^t - e^(2t)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: 1, 2\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 4.8e-07; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 0.0013\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "y' + 2y = exp(-t), y(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s + 2)Y(s) = 1/(s + 1)\n  Y(s) = 1/((s + 1)*(s + 2))\n  y(t) = e^(-t) - e^(-2t)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: -1, -2\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 5.6e-17; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 3.2e-14\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace_solve", "ucas": "laplace solve y' + 2y = exp(-t), y(0)=0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace_solve", "transformed": "(s + 2)Y(s) = 1/(s + 1)", "Y(s)": "1/((s + 1)*(s + 2))", "y(t)": {"value": "e^(-t) - e^(-2t)", "valid_for": "t >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "-1, -2", "headline": "y' + 2y = exp(-t), y(0) = 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 5.6e-17; initial values hold (max difference 0)"}, {"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 3.2e-14"}], "files": [], "text": "y' + 2y = exp(-t), y(0) = 0\n  transformed: (s + 2)Y(s) = 1/(s + 1)\n  Y(s) = 1/((s + 1)*(s + 2))\n  y(t) = e^(-t) - e^(-2t)    for t >= 0\n  poles of Y: -1, -2\n  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 5.6e-17; initial values hold (max difference 0)\n  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 3.2e-14\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x[n+1] = 2x[n], x[0] = 1\n  transformed: (z - 2)Y(z) - (z) = 0\n  Y(z) = z/(z - 2)\n  x[n] = 2^n    for n >= 0\n  poles of Y: 2\n  check: iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 0)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "zsolve", "ucas": "zsolve x[n+1] = 2x[n], x[0]=1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "zsolve", "transformed": "(z - 2)Y(z) - (z) = 0", "Y(z)": "z/(z - 2)", "x[n]": {"value": "2^n", "valid_for": "n >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "2", "headline": "x[n+1] = 2x[n], x[0] = 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 0)"}], "files": [], "text": "x[n+1] = 2x[n], x[0] = 1\n  transformed: (z - 2)Y(z) - (z) = 0\n  Y(z) = z/(z - 2)\n  x[n] = 2^n    for n >= 0\n  poles of Y: 2\n  check: iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 0)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x[k+2] = x[k+1] + x[k], x[0] = 0, x[1] = 1\n  transformed: (z^2 - z - 1)Y(z) - (z) = 0\n  Y(z) = z/(z^2 - z - 1)\n  x[k] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^k/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^k/5    for k >= 0\n  poles of Y: (1 + sqrt(5))/2, (1 - sqrt(5))/2\n  check: iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 1.2e-15)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "zsolve", "ucas": "zsolve x[k+2] = x[k+1] + x[k], x[0]=0, x[1]=1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "zsolve", "transformed": "(z^2 - z - 1)Y(z) - (z) = 0", "Y(z)": "z/(z^2 - z - 1)", "x[k]": {"value": "sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^k/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^k/5", "valid_for": "k >= 0"}, "poles_of_y": "(1 + sqrt(5))/2, (1 - sqrt(5))/2", "headline": "x[k+2] = x[k+1] + x[k], x[0] = 0, x[1] = 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 1.2e-15)"}], "files": [], "text": "x[k+2] = x[k+1] + x[k], x[0] = 0, x[1] = 1\n  transformed: (z^2 - z - 1)Y(z) - (z) = 0\n  Y(z) = z/(z^2 - z - 1)\n  x[k] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^k/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^k/5    for k >= 0\n  poles of Y: (1 + sqrt(5))/2, (1 - sqrt(5))/2\n  check: iterating the recurrence gives the same x[0..39] (max relative difference 1.2e-15)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: the last word x is read as the variable (write *x to multiply by it)\nFourier series of x on [-1, 1] (period 2):\n  f(x) ~ a0/2 + sum_{n>=1} a_n cos(pi*n*x) + b_n sin(pi*n*x)\n  a_n = int f(x) cos(pi*n*x) dx over the period, b_n likewise with sin\n  a0 = 0\n  a_n = 0 (f is odd)\n  b_n = -2(-1)^n/(pi*n)\n  check: the closed forms equal the numeric coefficients (Gauss-Legendre, 5120 nodes) for n = 1..48\n  f(x) ~ 2sin(pi*x)/pi - sin(2pi*x)/pi + 2sin(3pi*x)/(3pi) - sin(4pi*x)/(2pi) + 2sin(5pi*x)/(5pi) + ...\n  partial sums S_N: ||f - S_N||/||f|| = 0.332 (N = 5), 0.112 (N = 48)\n  converges to f where f is continuous, and to the midpoint of the jump where it jumps:\n    at x = 1 it jumps by -2: S_N -> 0\n  Gibbs: near x = 1, S_48 overshoots by 0.1585 = 7.9% of the jump (at x = 0.9796); the overshoot tends to 8.95% of the jump and does not shrink as N grows\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "fourier_series", "ucas": "fourier series x x on -1..1 period 2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "fourier_series", "a_n": ["int f(x) cos(pi*n*x) dx over the period, b_n likewise with sin", "0 (f is odd)"], "a0": "0", "b_n": "-2(-1)^n/(pi*n)", "partial_sums_s_n": "||f - S_N||/||f|| = 0.332 (N = 5), 0.112 (N = 48)", "gibbs": "near x = 1, S_48 overshoots by 0.1585 = 7.9% of the jump (at x = 0.9796); the overshoot tends to 8.95% of the jump and does not shrink as N grows", "headline": "Fourier series of x on [-1, 1] (period 2):", "details": ["f(x) ~ a0/2 + sum_{n>=1} a_n cos(pi*n*x) + b_n sin(pi*n*x)", "f(x) ~ 2sin(pi*x)/pi - sin(2pi*x)/pi + 2sin(3pi*x)/(3pi) - sin(4pi*x)/(2pi) + 2sin(5pi*x)/(5pi) + ...", "converges to f where f is continuous, and to the midpoint of the jump where it jumps:", "at x = 1 it jumps by -2: S_N -> 0"]}, "notes": [{"kind": "rule", "text": "the last word x is read as the variable (write *x to multiply by it)"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the closed forms equal the numeric coefficients (Gauss-Legendre, 5120 nodes) for n = 1..48"}], "files": [], "text": "  note: the last word x is read as the variable (write *x to multiply by it)\nFourier series of x on [-1, 1] (period 2):\n  f(x) ~ a0/2 + sum_{n>=1} a_n cos(pi*n*x) + b_n sin(pi*n*x)\n  a_n = int f(x) cos(pi*n*x) dx over the period, b_n likewise with sin\n  a0 = 0\n  a_n = 0 (f is odd)\n  b_n = -2(-1)^n/(pi*n)\n  check: the closed forms equal the numeric coefficients (Gauss-Legendre, 5120 nodes) for n = 1..48\n  f(x) ~ 2sin(pi*x)/pi - sin(2pi*x)/pi + 2sin(3pi*x)/(3pi) - sin(4pi*x)/(2pi) + 2sin(5pi*x)/(5pi) + ...\n  partial sums S_N: ||f - S_N||/||f|| = 0.332 (N = 5), 0.112 (N = 48)\n  converges to f where f is continuous, and to the midpoint of the jump where it jumps:\n    at x = 1 it jumps by -2: S_N -> 0\n  Gibbs: near x = 1, S_48 overshoots by 0.1585 = 7.9% of the jump (at x = 0.9796); the overshoot tends to 8.95% of the jump and does not shrink as N grows\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 8, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "fibonacci: a[n+2] = a[n+1] + a[n], a[0] = 0, a[1] = 1\n  a[n] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5\n  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = x/(1 - x - x^2)    for |x| < (-1 + sqrt(5))/2\n  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = (-1 + sqrt(5))/4 is 0.518927630227216, G = 0.518927630227215 (difference 1.1e-16)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "genfunc", "ucas": "genfunc Fibonacci", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "genfunc", "a[n]": "sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5", "G(x)": {"value": "sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = x/(1 - x - x^2)", "valid_for": "|x| < (-1 + sqrt(5))/2"}, "headline": "fibonacci: a[n+2] = a[n+1] + a[n], a[0] = 0, a[1] = 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "sum_n a_n x^n at x = (-1 + sqrt(5))/4 is 0.518927630227216, G = 0.518927630227215 (difference 1.1e-16)"}], "files": [], "text": "fibonacci: a[n+2] = a[n+1] + a[n], a[0] = 0, a[1] = 1\n  a[n] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5\n  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = x/(1 - x - x^2)    for |x| < (-1 + sqrt(5))/2\n  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = (-1 + sqrt(5))/4 is 0.518927630227216, G = 0.518927630227215 (difference 1.1e-16)\n"}, "isError": false}}
